# Lemo source spritesheets — 197 MB of 2048² cells. Only the sliced/downscaled
# Art/Lemo/Sheets/*.png (~950 KB) ship; keep the masters out of git history.
Art/Lemo/*.png
# reff.png is small and is where the spawn/wander coords were measured — keep it.
!Art/Lemo/reff.png

# Fireplace fire source spritesheet (4x8 grid of 1500x1920 cells, ~12 MB) — only the
# sliced Art/Fire/fire_NN.png sequence (~890 KB) ships. Keep the master out of git.
Art/Fireplace Fire.png

# Trophy masters. The shipped set is Art/trophies/*.webp (~190 KB) cropped to the
# painted art out of these 2000² PNGs, and Art/Workspace/Workspace_0013b_Trophy_Shelf.png
# cropped out of the full-canvas world master (also parked in Art/trophies, so the
# pre-commit manifest globber never sees it). Keep them local, like Lemo's.
Art/trophies/*.png
# Trophy_Collect ships trimmed to 25s (4s fade); this is the untouched 111s master.
Sound/Trophy_Collect.full.mp3
# player_Fall ships re-encoded at 128k; this is the 242k original.
Sound/player_Fall.full.mp3
